What is the upper bound on the number of elements shifted during an add(i, x) or remove(i) operation in an ArrayDeque containing n elements?

A. n
B. min{i, n - i}
C. max{i, n - i}
D. i + n

Think briefly, then end your response with a line of the form 'Answer: X' where X is one of A, B, C, D.
